        /// <summary>template เดิมจาก seeder กับใบในคลังใหม่ที่สืบทอดแนวคิด ใช้ย้าย item ในชุดคูปองก่อนปิดของเดิม</summary>
        private static readonly (string Legacy, string Replacement)[] LegacyReplacements =
        [
        ("ตั๋วกอดไม่อั้น", "กอดไม่อั้น"),
        ("ตั๋วมื้อนี้ฉันเลี้ยง", "เลี้ยงหนึ่งมื้อ"),
        ("ตั๋วขอพร 1 ข้อ", "ขอพรหนึ่งข้อ"),
        ("ตั๋วตามใจ 1 วัน", "ตามใจหนึ่งวัน"),
        ("ตั๋วอัญเชิญ", "คู่ควงงานนี้"),
        ("ตั๋วอะไรก็ได้ไม่เกิน 10,000 บาท", "เงินหมื่นให้เธอ"),
        ("ตั๋วทริปพิเศษ", "ทริปของเรา"),
        ];

        private static string Sql(string value) => "'" + value.Replace("'", "''") + "'";

        /// <summary>เพิ่มคลังใหม่ (ข้ามชื่อที่มีอยู่แล้ว), ย้ายชุดคูปองจาก template เดิมไปใบใหม่ แล้วปิด template เดิม 7 แบบ</summary>
        private static void ImportLibrary(MigrationBuilder migrationBuilder)
        {
            foreach (var c in Library)
            {
                migrationBuilder.Sql($"""
                    INSERT INTO "CouponTemplates" ("Name", "Description", "Terms", "Rarity", "Category", "Effect", "MetaLocked", "IsActive", "IsDeleted", "CreatedAt")
                    SELECT {Sql(c.Name)}, {Sql(c.Description)}, {Sql(c.Terms)}, {Sql(c.Rarity)}, {Sql(c.Category)}, {Sql(c.Effect)}, {(c.MetaLocked ? "TRUE" : "FALSE")}, TRUE, FALSE, now()
                    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(c.Name)} AND NOT "IsDeleted");
                    """);
            }

            foreach (var (legacy, replacement) in LegacyReplacements)
            {
                migrationBuilder.Sql($"""
                    UPDATE "CouponSetItems" AS i
                    SET "CouponTemplateId" = (SELECT "Id" FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(replacement)} AND NOT "IsDeleted" ORDER BY "Id" LIMIT 1)
                    WHERE i."CouponTemplateId" IN (SELECT "Id" FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(legacy)})
                      AND NOT EXISTS (
                        SELECT 1 FROM "CouponSetItems" AS x
                        WHERE x."SetId" = i."SetId"
                          AND x."CouponTemplateId" = (SELECT "Id" FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(replacement)} AND NOT "IsDeleted" ORDER BY "Id" LIMIT 1));
                    UPDATE "CouponTemplates" SET "IsActive" = FALSE, "UpdatedAt" = now()
                    WHERE "Name" = {Sql(legacy)} AND "IsActive";
                    """);
            }
        }

        /// <summary>ย้อนกลับ: เปิด template เดิม ย้ายชุดคูปองกลับ และลบใบใหม่ที่ยังไม่เคยถูกมอบหรือใช้อ้างอิง</summary>
        private static void RemoveLibrary(MigrationBuilder migrationBuilder)
        {
            foreach (var (legacy, replacement) in LegacyReplacements)
            {
                migrationBuilder.Sql($"""
                    UPDATE "CouponTemplates" SET "IsActive" = TRUE, "UpdatedAt" = now() WHERE "Name" = {Sql(legacy)} AND NOT "IsDeleted";
                    UPDATE "CouponSetItems"
                    SET "CouponTemplateId" = (SELECT "Id" FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(legacy)} AND NOT "IsDeleted" ORDER BY "Id" LIMIT 1)
                    WHERE "CouponTemplateId" IN (SELECT "Id" FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(replacement)})
                      AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM "CouponTemplates" WHERE "Name" = {Sql(legacy)} AND NOT "IsDeleted");
                    """);
            }

            foreach (var c in Library)
            {
                migrationBuilder.Sql($"""
                    DELETE FROM "CouponTemplates" AS t
                    WHERE t."Name" = {Sql(c.Name)}
                      AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM "IssuedCoupons" WHERE "CouponTemplateId" = t."Id")
                      AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM "CouponSetItems" WHERE "CouponTemplateId" = t."Id")
                      AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM "Redemptions" WHERE "TargetTemplateId" = t."Id");
                    """);
            }
        }
    }
